      "message": "I am realizing now with this API that both Ganesh and Graphite could fail to measure the GPU elapsed time, so we should be checking that `stats` has the information we want to pass to the `GpuTimerCallback`, and/or other error checking.\n\nShould we just pass in a negative value or 0 to as the elapsed time?",
